      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَادٌ</span></b>  <i>A place where camels go to and fro in
pasturing;</i> (S, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْتَرَادٌ</span></b> . (K.) And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَادُ الرِّيحِ</span> <i>The place where the wind</i> [<i>blows to
